      "My pace is spilling into my soul, family, team, or culture.",
      "I am making high-stakes choices without steady faith-aligned counsel.",
    ],
    prompts: [
      "Which sign is most active right now?",
      "What has this pattern protected me from?",
      "What is this pattern now costing me?",
      "Who could help me carry this with wisdom and truth?",
    ],
    nextStep:
      "Choose one trusted person and say, “I am carrying more than I usually say, and I need a wiser way to process it.”",
  },
  {
    eyebrow: "Resource 02 · Comment keyword CLARITY",
    title: "Decision Clarity Checklist",
    id: "decision-clarity-checklist",
    bestFor: "A difficult decision that needs more than speed, pressure, or instinct.",
    purpose: "Use these questions before you choose, delay, delegate, or respond.",
    checklistTitle: "Work through the five clarity questions.",
    checklist: [
