    title: "Team Alignment Assessment",
    id: "team-alignment-assessment",
    bestFor: "Owners, executives, pastors, and team leaders who sense drift before people say it out loud.",
    purpose: "Use this assessment to see whether your team is moving with shared clarity and trust.",
    checklistTitle: "Rate each area from 1–5, then note what needs attention.",
    checklist: [
      "Purpose: We know what matters most in this season.",
